{
  "statement": "I appreciate the ongoing discussions and the emphasis on safety, efficiency, and sustainability. However, I must maintain my position on the importance of SAF-02 and SAF-03, as they are critical for ensuring safety during critical failures. I propose a synthesis where we integrate safety, efficiency, and energy consumption metrics into the protocols for executing Minimal Risk Maneuvers (SAF-02), ensuring that necessary safety actions are taken while still aiming for overall efficiency. Additionally, I support the idea of relaxing energy consumption targets during emergency maneuvers (GRN-07) to prioritize safety without completely disregarding efficiency.",
